{"version":1,"content":"<html><body><figure><img src=\"https://cdn3.am730.com.hk/processed/2026-08/1065703/block/singleImage/3277969/wm/01KZ7GKA30M72B160ZA4C65EJX.jpg?updatedAt=1795602731\"/><figcaption>港燈下調12月燃料調整費，每度電52.3仙。(資料圖片)</figcaption></figure><p>港燈今日 (25 日 ) 宣布，下月燃料調整費向下調，由 11 月的每度電 55.1 仙，下調至每度電 52.3 仙。燃料調整費會按月調整，以適時反映發電燃料成本的變動。港燈今年的燃料調整費一度於 9 月達到全年最高的每度電 60.7 仙，之後持續下降。 中電表示，燃料調整費會按照使用燃料的實際價格和原來預測價格的差別每月自動調整，以適時反映燃料價格的變動。由下月1日起，燃料調整費由11 月的每度電47.4仙，上調至 每度電48.5仙。</p></body></html>","scraped_at":"2026-11-25T10:43:56.524107+00:00","quality":{"score":1,"chars":249,"images":1,"source":"am730","fallback":"none","origin":"article-html","completeness":"extracted"},"published_at":"2026-11-25T09:37:43+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-11-26T02:52:43.614515+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-11-25T10:37:18.519712+00:00","content_hash":"b65da8ba2e680827a7479acd4a2b934e7816370e65b24733063834e1f351daff","evidence_status":"full","scrape_error":null,"content_retention":{"scraped_at":"2026-11-25T10:43:56.524107+00:00","latest_fallback":"rss-budget","latest_error":null},"content_capture":null}